        "description": "<p>Recent Post Widget With Two Option Slider and List.</p>\n<p>For more features please contact us at <a href=\"http://www.logicrays.com/contact-us-logicrays-india/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Logicrays</a>.<br />\nIf you like this plugin please rate us 🙂</p>\n<h3>Plugin Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>All modern browser support</li>\n<li>Works with any type of theme</li>\n<li>Easy to customize for developers</li>\n<li>Easy to configure</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"a%20question%20that%20someone%20might%20have\">\nA question that someone might have\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>An answer to that question.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
